<section>
    <h2>Contact Hood Queen</h2>

    <p>
        Have a question, collaboration idea, or want to be part
        of the movement? Reach out to Hood Queen.
    </p>
</section>


<section>
    <h2>Business Inquiries</h2>

    <div>
        <p>Email:</p>
        <p>your-email@example.com</p>

        <p>Instagram:</p>
        <p>@hood_queen.xiv</p>
    </div>
</section>


<section>
    <h2>Join The Movement</h2>

    <p>
        Hood Queen is built for dreamers, creators, survivors,
        and anyone chasing something bigger.
    </p>

    <p>
        The Hood Made Us. Royalty Became Us.
    </p>
</section>


<section>
    <h2>Message Us</h2>

    <form>

        <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name">

        <br><br>

        <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email">

        <br><br>

        <textarea placeholder="Your Message"></textarea>

        <br><br>

        <button type="submit">
            Send Message
        </button>

    </form>

</section>


<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Hood Queen. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    <p>The Hood Made Us. Royalty Became Us.</p>
</footer>


